*
E11 1bx 1by VALUE={length/2*(Rnn*I(V11)+Rmn*I(V21)+Rmn*I(V31))+length/2*(Lself*DDT(I(V11))+Lm*DDT(I(V21))+Lm*DDT(I(V31)))} tripdv={tdv} tripdt={tdt}
