Br0 0 L4 i=((1+h0)/2)*((1+h0)/Z0*delay(v(L1),tau0)-h0*delay(i(Bs0),tau0))+((1-h0)/2)*((1+h0)/Z0*delay(v(L4),tau0)-h0*delay(i(Br0),tau0))
