.SUBCKT stalu_u10_o70mm2_transposed_coupled 1a 2a 3a 1b 2b 3b
+PARAMS: R0s=1.212 R1s=0.404 L0s=0.00445636 L1s=0.00111409 C0s=4.5n C1s=10n R0R1=0 L0L1=0
