.SUBCKT MK_u20_o50mm2_transposed_distributed_coupled 1a 2a 3a 1b 2b 3b
+PARAMS: R0s=1.071 R1s=0.357 L0s=0.0013197 L1s=0.00043990 C0s=280n C1s=280n R0R1=0 L0L1=0
